WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.192
Either you're a meat eater or&nbsp;you're a vegetarian.

00:00:03.192 --> 00:00:06.727
So I wondered, might there be a third solution?

00:00:06.727 --> 00:00:09.240
And I thought&nbsp;about it, and I came up with one.  

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.402
And I've been doing it for the
 last year, and it's great.

00:00:11.402 --> 00:00:14.272
It's&nbsp;called weekday veg. The name says it all:

00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:17.555
Nothing with a face Monday through Friday.

00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:20.368
On the weekend,&nbsp;your choice.

00:00:20.368 --> 00:00:23.764
It's structured, so it ends up 
being simple to remember,

00:00:23.764 --> 00:00:26.095
and it's okay to break it&nbsp;here and there.

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:30.912
After all, cutting five days a week is 
cutting 70 percent of your meat intake.

00:00:30.912 --> 00:00:33.635
The program has been great, I'm healthier,

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:36.004
I know that I'm going to live longer,

00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:38.068
my footprint's&nbsp;smaller,

00:00:38.068 --> 00:00:40.510
I'm lessening pollution,

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.172
I feel better about the animals,

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:43.806
I'm even saving money.

00:00:43.806 --> 00:00:46.165
What's&nbsp;stopping you from giving 
weekday veg a shot?

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.992
After all, if all of us

00:00:49.992 --> 00:00:51.959
ate half as much meat,

00:00:51.959 --> 00:00:55.055
it would be like half of us were vegetarians.

